  52:     // — it waits for a human yes. The fixture said REVIEW, which is the
  53:     // anchors-disagree state and would have named no deciding anchor at all.
  54:     //
  55:     // The rest of the row is the SAME producible case, taken from the generator
  56:     // that emits it (`applySingleAnchorScore`, state `exact_ean`,
  57:     // generation_service.go:538-547): 60/MEDIA, an `ean` FOR, and the missing
  58:     // corroborating anchor as INCOMPARABLE on the provider side. The old
